<title>JAPAN: Japan to discuss forex, c/a surplus at G7 -- MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan to discuss forex, c/a surplus at G7 -- MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan will discuss foreign exchange levels and its current account surplus at the upcoming meeting of the Group of Seven (G7) industrialised nations in Denver, Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
